{"chapter": "artin", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "0CXN", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0003": "$(\\Sch/S)_{fppf}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0005": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\nB' \\ar[r] & B \\\\\nA' = A \\times_B B' \\ar[u] \\ar[r] & A \\ar[u]\n}\n$$", "MATH_0006": "$S$", "MATH_0007": "$B' \\to B$", "MATH_0008": "$$\n\\mathcal{X}_{\\Spec(A')}\n\\longrightarrow\n\\mathcal{X}_{\\Spec(A)} \\times_{\\mathcal{X}_{\\Spec(B)}} \\mathcal{X}_{\\Spec(B')}\n$$", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-RS-star}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:76e6a0bb59044a95c94392f5a8e2ed799ed4dbe163054ac28d3e4d188fada261", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:347a74e90485bac6eb79c9a4864949bac147bcc12720107a75e76be03460dca6", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a scheme. Let <MATH_0002> be a category\nfibred in groupoids over <MATH_0003>. We say <MATH_0004>\nsatisfies <TEXTITOPEN_0001>condition (RS*)<TEXTITCLOSE_0001> if given a fibre product diagram\n<MATH_0005>\nof <MATH_0006>-algebras, with <MATH_0007> surjective with square zero kernel,\nthe functor of fibre categories\n<MATH_0008>\nis an equivalence of categories.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:068c14e8ea8d1567a6da38d76ec3d00a18ac302b998626c7ac377806bdeb344c", "unit_id": "tag:07Y8:statement"}
